                "text": "Hospitals are already feeling the squeeze from Medicaid cuts \u2013 with fewer staff, shrinking budgets, and rising patient loads pushing our health care system to its limits. This means longer wait times, fewer treatment options, and care that\u2019s stretched too thin. We can\u2019t let partisan games jeopardize people\u2019s lives \u2013 we must protect Medicaid, and the care families depend on. \nhttps://t.co/SKPX94Q2KL",
