                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "On #RuralHealthDay, I\u2019m sounding the alarm: Republican health care cuts hit rural Nevada the hardest. Providers across my 50,000 square-mile district told me directly: these cuts mean fewer nurses, fewer hospitals, diminished care, and longer distances to get treatment. In some cases, this means traveling even farther for diabetes care, cancer treatment, or maternity services that are already 90 minutes away. We must protect the health care that keeps rural Nevada alive.",
